<div class="container mx-auto max-w-lg px-2">
  <h1 class="text-4xl text-center my-10 mx-2">Bernardo Amorim</h1>
  <img
    src="https://github.com/bamorim.png"
    alt="Photo of Bernardo Amorim"
    class="w-64 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-400 mx-auto my-10 aspect-square"
  />
  <section class="my-10">
    <h1 class="text-xl my-5">Links</h1>
    <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 xs:grid-cols-3">
      <li :for={link <- @links}>
        <a
          href={link.url}
          target={if link.external, do: "_blank"}
          class="block bg-white rounded-md p-2 border-2 border-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-100 text-lg dark:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-700"
        >
          <i class={"ri-#{link.icon}-fill align-bottom"} />
          <span>{link.name}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="my-10">
    <h1 class="text-xl my-5">About Me</h1>
    <p class="my-2">
      I'm a software engineer interested in developer productivity and tooling, programming
      languages in general (especially functional ones) and learning (both for myself but also
      for others).
    </p>
    <p class="my-2">
      I've been writing Elixir since 2017 and got involved (and in love) with the community
      through meetups and giving talks at events. Lately I've also been writing a lot of
      TypeScript and Go, and these days I'm a founding engineer at an early-stage startup.
    </p>
    <p class="my-2">
      Apart from that, I'm a huge fan of Counter-Strike and used to play handball for the
      university team.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
